※ pl4g-test: compile=error diag=4475

※ `_` is not a variable: it is the place a value is sent to when the program
※ means to work it out and not use it.  Nothing is stored there, so there is
※ nothing to read back.

fn twice(n: u8) → u8:
    n + n

@[startup]
fn main() → u8:
    _ ← twice(4u8)
    _
